<questions><question-record><question>Es el proceso que permite obtener la energ&amp;#x00ED;a y los nutrientes necesarios para vivir.</question><clue></clue><category></category><weighting>100</weighting><fixed>0</fixed><question-type>2</question-type><answers><answer><text>Nutrici&amp;#x00F3;n</text><feedback></feedback><correct>1</correct><percent-correct>100</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>La nutrici&amp;#x00F3;n</text><feedback></feedback><correct>1</correct><percent-correct>100</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text></text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text></text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer></answers></question-record><question-record><question>Transforma los alimentos en nutrientes a trav&amp;#x00E9;s de la digesti&amp;#x00F3;n, para que pasen a la sandre y sean aprovechados por las c&amp;#x00E9;lulas.</question><clue></clue><category></category><weighting>100</weighting><fixed>0</fixed><question-type>1</question-type><answers><answer><text>APARATO DIGESTIVO</text><feedback></feedback><correct>1</correct><percent-correct>100</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>APARATO RESPIRATORIO</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>APARATO CIRCULATORIO</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>APARATO EXCRETOR</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer></answers></question-record><question-record><question>Capta el ox&amp;#x00ED;geneo del aire para que las c&amp;#x00E9;lulas obtengan energ&amp;#x00ED;a y se expulsa el di&amp;#x00F3;xido de carbono que las c&amp;#x00E9;lulas producen como sustancia de desecho.</question><clue></clue><category></category><weighting>100</weighting><fixed>0</fixed><question-type>1</question-type><answers><answer><text>APARATO DIGESTIVO</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>APARATO RESPIRATORIO</text><feedback></feedback><correct>1</correct><percent-correct>100</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>APARATO CIRCULATORIO</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>APARATO EXCRETOR</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer></answers></question-record><question-record><question>Transporta los nutrientes y el ox&amp;#x00ED;geneno a trav&amp;#x00E9;s de la sangre a las c&amp;#x00E9;lulas, y las sustancias de desecjo para su eliminaci&amp;#x00F3;n.</question><clue></clue><category></category><weighting>100</weighting><fixed>0</fixed><question-type>1</question-type><answers><answer><text>APARATO DIGESTIVO</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>APARATO RESPIRATORIO</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>APARATO CIRCULATORIO</text><feedback></feedback><correct>1</correct><percent-correct>100</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>APARATO EXCRETOR</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer></answers></question-record><question-record><question>Filtra la sangre y elimina las sustancias de desecho en forma de sudor (por la gl&amp;#x00E1;ndulas sudor&amp;#x00ED;paras)  en de la orina, a trav&amp;#x00E9;s del aparato urinario.</question><clue></clue><category></category><weighting>100</weighting><fixed>0</fixed><question-type>1</question-type><answers><answer><text>APARATO DIGESTIVO</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>APARATO RESPIRATORIO</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>APARATO CIRCULATORIO</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>APARATO EXCRETOR</text><feedback></feedback><correct>1</correct><percent-correct>100</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer></answers></question-record><question-record><question>Indica qu&amp;#x00E9; es correcto seg&amp;#x00FA;n los n&amp;#x00FA;meros de la imagen:
&amp;#x003C;img src=&quot;NUTRICI&amp;#x00D3;N/IMAGENES/DigestivoSin1.png&quot; alt=&quot;DigestivoSin1.png&quot; title=&quot;DigestivoSin1&quot; width=&quot;200&quot; height=&quot;316&quot; style=&quot;display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;&quot;/&amp;#x003E;</question><clue></clue><category></category><weighting>100</weighting><fixed>0</fixed><question-type>1</question-type><answers><answer><text>Boca, faringe, recto, ano.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Es&amp;#x00F3;fago, est&amp;#x00F3;mago, intestino delgado,intestino grueso.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>1</correct><percent-correct>100</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Ano, recto, faringe, boca</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Intestino delgado, intestino grueso, es&amp;#x00F3;fago, est&amp;#x00F3;mago.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer></answers></question-record><question-record><question>Indica qu&amp;#x00E9; es correcto seg&amp;#x00FA;n los n&amp;#x00FA;meros de la imagen:
&amp;#x003C;img src=&quot;NUTRICI&amp;#x00D3;N/IMAGENES/DigestivoSin2.png&quot; alt=&quot;DigestivoSin2.png&quot; title=&quot;DigestivoSin2&quot; width=&quot;200&quot; height=&quot;316&quot; style=&quot;display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;&quot;/&amp;#x003E;</question><clue></clue><category></category><weighting>100</weighting><fixed>0</fixed><question-type>1</question-type><answers><answer><text>Boca, faringe, recto, ano.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Es&amp;#x00F3;fago, est&amp;#x00F3;mago, intestino delgado,intestino grueso.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Recto, boca, ano, faringe</text><feedback></feedback><correct>1</correct><percent-correct>100</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Intestino delgado, intestino grueso, es&amp;#x00F3;fago, est&amp;#x00F3;mago.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer></answers></question-record><question-record><question>Indica qu&amp;#x00E9; es correcto seg&amp;#x00FA;n los n&amp;#x00FA;meros de la imagen:
&amp;#x003C;img src=&quot;NUTRICI&amp;#x00D3;N/IMAGENES/RespiratorioSin1.png&quot; alt=&quot;RespiratorioSin1.png&quot; title=&quot;RespiratorioSin1&quot; width=&quot;200&quot; height=&quot;296&quot; style=&quot;display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;&quot;/&amp;#x003E;</question><clue></clue><category></category><weighting>100</weighting><fixed>0</fixed><question-type>1</question-type><answers><answer><text>Pulmones, bronquios, alv&amp;#x00E9;olos pulmonares, bronquiolos.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Fosas nasales, faringe, laringe, tr&amp;#x00E1;quea.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Bronquios, pulmones,  bronquiolos, alv&amp;#x00E9;olos pulmonares.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Faringe, laringe, fosas nasales, tr&amp;#x00E1;quea.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>1</correct><percent-correct>100</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer></answers></question-record><question-record><question>Indica qu&amp;#x00E9; es correcto seg&amp;#x00FA;n los n&amp;#x00FA;meros de la imagen:
&amp;#x003C;img src=&quot;NUTRICI&amp;#x00D3;N/IMAGENES/RespiratorioSin2.png&quot; alt=&quot;RespiratorioSin2.png&quot; title=&quot;RespiratorioSin2&quot; width=&quot;200&quot; height=&quot;296&quot; style=&quot;display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;&quot;/&amp;#x003E;</question><clue></clue><category></category><weighting>100</weighting><fixed>0</fixed><question-type>1</question-type><answers><answer><text>Pulmones, bronquios, alv&amp;#x00E9;olos pulmonares, bronquiolos.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Fosas nasales, faringe, laringe, tr&amp;#x00E1;quea.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Bronquios, pulmones,  bronquiolos, alv&amp;#x00E9;olos pulmonares.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Faringe, laringe, fosas nasales, tr&amp;#x00E1;quea.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>1</correct><percent-correct>100</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer></answers></question-record><question-record><question>Indica qu&amp;#x00E9; es correcto seg&amp;#x00FA;n los n&amp;#x00FA;meros de la imagen:
&amp;#x003C;img src=&quot;NUTRICI&amp;#x00D3;N/IMAGENES/ExcretorSin1.png&quot; alt=&quot;ExcretorSin1.png&quot; title=&quot;ExcretorSin1&quot; width=&quot;200&quot; height=&quot;319&quot; style=&quot;display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;&quot;/&amp;#x003E;</question><clue></clue><category></category><weighting>100</weighting><fixed>0</fixed><question-type>1</question-type><answers><answer><text>Poro, gl&amp;#x00E1;ndula sudor&amp;#x00ED;para, capilares.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Ur&amp;#x00E9;teres, veijiga, ri&amp;#x00F1;ones, uretra.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>1</correct><percent-correct>100</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Capilares, poro, gl&amp;#x00E1;ndula sudor&amp;#x00ED;para</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Uretra, veijiga, ur&amp;#x00E9;teres, ri&amp;#x00F1;ones</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer></answers></question-record><question-record><question>Indica qu&amp;#x00E9; es correcto seg&amp;#x00FA;n los n&amp;#x00FA;meros de la imagen:
&amp;#x003C;img src=&quot;NUTRICI&amp;#x00D3;N/IMAGENES/ExcretorSin2.png&quot; alt=&quot;ExcretorSin2.png&quot; title=&quot;ExcretorSin2&quot; width=&quot;200&quot; height=&quot;319&quot; style=&quot;display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;&quot;/&amp;#x003E;</question><clue></clue><category></category><weighting>100</weighting><fixed>0</fixed><question-type>1</question-type><answers><answer><text>Poro, gl&amp;#x00E1;ndula sudor&amp;#x00ED;para, capilares.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Ur&amp;#x00E9;teres, veijiga, ri&amp;#x00F1;ones, uretra.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Capilares, poro, gl&amp;#x00E1;ndula sudor&amp;#x00ED;para</text><feedback></feedback><correct>1</correct><percent-correct>100</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Uretra, veijiga, ur&amp;#x00E9;teres, ri&amp;#x00F1;ones</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer></answers></question-record><question-record><question>Parte l&amp;#x00ED;quida de la sangre que contiene nutrientes y desechos.</question><clue></clue><category></category><weighting>100</weighting><fixed>0</fixed><question-type>2</question-type><answers><answer><text>Plasma</text><feedback></feedback><correct>1</correct><percent-correct>100</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>El plasma</text><feedback></feedback><correct>1</correct><percent-correct>100</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text></text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text></text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer></answers></question-record><question-record><question>La parte s&amp;#x00F3;lida de la sangre se compone de tres tipos de c&amp;#x00E9;lulas: los gl&amp;#x00F3;bulos rojos, los gl&amp;#x00F3;bulos blancos y el plasma.</question><clue></clue><category></category><weighting>100</weighting><fixed>0</fixed><question-type>1</question-type><answers><answer><text>VERADERO</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>FALSO</text><feedback></feedback><correct>1</correct><percent-correct>100</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text></text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text></text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer></answers></question-record><question-record><question>El aparato digestivo obtiene los nutrientes a trav&amp;#x00E9;s de la digesti&amp;#x00F3;n.</question><clue></clue><category></category><weighting>100</weighting><fixed>0</fixed><question-type>1</question-type><answers><answer><text>VERDADERO</text><feedback></feedback><correct>1</correct><percent-correct>100</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>FALSO</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text></text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text></text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer></answers></question-record><question-record><question>El aparto circulatorio filtra la sandre y elimina las sustancia de desecho.</question><clue></clue><category></category><weighting>100</weighting><fixed>0</fixed><question-type>1</question-type><answers><answer><text>VERDADERO</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>FALSO</text><feedback></feedback><correct>1</correct><percent-correct>100</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text></text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text></text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer></answers></question-record></questions>
